{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_048_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6e77940af2938baa61a6c6963393821346e604bb9d31d0969a1c27cdf84daebd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a8bab1c857e36ee7e90cfb7f8d8c9694e631dc49e6abe42fc83ac58210d56ce",
      "text": "情人节巧克力，谢谢你♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43b89dddfbe9e748fc6d59135ad527e89a8d808d322de41334f0d9121bfb2b1c",
      "text": "是倾注了●●●●●●●●●●P酱的Passion的\n巧克力？对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76caf09d0975dd83d5132282808418b1c75d560b66b7d81d237a51306f6d9729",
      "text": "我一直想着要是能从你那里收到巧克力就好了呢，\n好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca6e8bfd0012f77e10c5397bf102e355085c519e2c0a9dca5f2c1d75909b9a4",
      "text": "……谢谢你。\n无论说多少次，感觉都说不够呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92002405eb56b5fb0fe759b69e6f8884ea537cb9ae64946ea3263c3d079a4ea4",
      "text": "作为谢礼，作为偶像我也会加倍努力的。\n首先必须让今天的工作圆满成功才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9642440c62bc15dc3cafcbadc823e48d7793edf57ba7fb2d41b4368470bd04d5",
      "text": "哇啊，是●●●●●●●●●●P酱送的\n情人节巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eba62d317f100cf2b6731aef6136d401cc3f678deab45fbb71ee00b02993b59e",
      "text": "真的非常感谢……好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b821c1ef0ec73acdedf25f6bd4d539dc18a8a3c88eda5f462321faede659a189",
      "text": "我就猜想P酱一定会给我的。\n可是，心里还是一直坐立不安呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68cbd4131b4087d03d118b44959d103e50e2c7c9754ec24b40ddaf4c88a846f9",
      "text": "一直在想会在什么时机送给我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:575ceaa99534f871c693e07e01b347898a5d9a37778bb284d3fd9bc38edd3b07",
      "text": "我其实注意到了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b48913912fb571b4e44631edea4e685dc3c9ec087ee7d8acda79aedc9871b76",
      "text": "原来是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e63d6e6ee7c3137afbb7b6f719644244f6a1caba7e9cae20bacd005f2edc00b2",
      "text": "哎呀，好坏心眼……\n既然注意到了，早点跟我说也可以嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc35eea9c92aa6884f4a5efce90b3d3e5af45a1795cf81cd7537fccb59c281d",
      "text": "嗯。又坐立不安，又心跳加速的。\n如果藏得足够好的话，那就太好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c0dcdb9bbee2b1228fa60ea5dc074ac816ce9d92c9ad7e0782d3124b28f6b94",
      "text": "……巧克力，真的很谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_22:5_01_048_22_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6d9a0508fc6fc898281e48def7aa6b020955ba7e1d3ea778e3ce3bd62ea1e4f",
      "text": "毕竟里面倾注了●●●●●●●●●●P酱的心意嘛。\n我会好好珍惜着吃完的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
